Peter Revello made his late-night debut on 'The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon' last November, and now he's bringing his relatable New York humor to Houston. Known for his sharp, blue-collar perspective and personal stories, Peter's comedy hits home whether he's talking about Staten Island, marriage, or just the quirks of everyday life. Catch him live at The Riot Comedy Club upstairs at Rudyard's on Friday, April 10, 2026. 🎤 Link in bio for tickets. Tag someone you'd bring.

